          <span class="crp-modal-bank-acct"><span class="wl-ko">농협</span><span class="wl-en">NH</span> 301-0343-5409-21</span>
          <span class="crp-modal-bank-holder wl-ko">예금주: (사)한국생명의말씀협회</span>
